  <data key="d0">Transformer Model Architecture Diagram (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This image illustrates the architecture of the Transformer model, highlighting the encoder-decoder structure and the use of self-attention mechanisms. It serves as a visual aid to the surrounding text, which discusses the model's advantages over traditional recurrent networks in sequence modeling tasks.</data>
