<node id="Attention Mechanisms in Transformer Architecture (image)">
  <data key="d0">Attention Mechanisms in Transformer Architecture (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">Figure 2 illustrates the 'Scaled Dot-Product Attention' and 'Multi-Head Attention' mechanisms, key components of the Transformer architecture. This image complements the surrounding text by visually representing the processes described in the encoder and decoder stacks, enhancing understanding of how attention functions within the model.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-534bf53554d9a065746bdcec8d950afd</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1763838602</data>
