<node id="Scaled Dot-Product Attention (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Scaled Dot-Product Attention (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">This equation defines the Scaled Dot-Product Attention mechanism, crucial for the Transformer model, enabling dynamic focus on input sequences through weighted sums of values based on query-key interactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-28a766b21d9207adb4674a8334c4fda3</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1763838602</data>
</node>
