  <data key="d0">Dot Product Variance Explanation (discarded)</data>
  <data key="d1">discarded</data>
  <data key="d2">This content explains the variance of the dot product of query and key vectors in attention mechanisms, highlighting the need for scaling to maintain effective learning in the Transformer model.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-26cc075f9d824f3964b4f5c6bcfbd8e7</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
