<node id="Positional Encoding Equations (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Positional Encoding Equations (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">These equations define the sine and cosine functions used for positional encodings in the Transformer model, enabling the model to incorporate token order information effectively.</data>
